<title>USA: Harrington Financial to buy back shares.</title>
<headline>Harrington Financial to buy back shares.</headline>
<dateline>RICHMOND, Va. 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harrington Financial Group Inc said on Friday that it has approved the repurchase of up to five percent, or 162,000, of its common shares.</p>
<p>The company has about 3.2 million shares outstanding, Harrington said in a statement.</p>
<p>The shares for this repurchase program will be purchased over the next 12 months and will be used to partially fund the company's employee stock ownership plan, Harrington said.</p>
